// Zweck: plant pot with saucer (assembly) – pot as a loft from the rounded square
// (superellipse as spline, points from a function) to the round opening, feet and
// drain holes; saucer as rotate_extrude opened at the top with shell and rounded via
// zones. The pot stands with the anchor `aufstand` on the anchor `boden` of the saucer.
// Check: `mcad measure pflanztopf.mcad --interference --clearance topf untersetzer`. Dimensions in mm.
include <masse.mcad>
use <teile.mcad>

untersetzer: untersetzer();
translate(untersetzer.boden) topf: topf();
